%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9f8f4b72b647c7d4687c9d6cdb959825, type: 3}
  m_Name: AffinityMapping
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AffinityMapping
  rows:
  - type: 1
    flags:
    - flag_bellows
    - flag_quench
    readBack: You worked the forge and did not flinch.
    identity: Temper and hunger. Everything is fuel.
  - type: 2
    flags:
    - flag_draw_well
    - flag_fill_jug
    - flag_free_net
    readBack: You went toward the water when others would not.
    identity: Patience that wears down mountains.
  - type: 3
    flags:
    - 'flag_mill_climb '
    - flag_free_pigeon
    readBack: You climbed for the view, and freed what was caught.
    identity: Nothing holds what will not be held.
  - type: 4
    flags:
    - flag_dig_grave
    - flag_dig_row
    - flag_haul_stones
    readBack: You turned the ground with your own hands.
    identity: Deep, and slow, and certain.
  - type: 5
    flags:
    - flag_smash_crates
    - flag_take_offering
    readBack: You took what was watched, and broke what was stacked.
    identity: What is taken in the dark, stays.
  - type: 6
    flags:
    - flag_help_healer
    - flag_light_candle
    - flag_give_alms
    readBack: You mended more than you broke.
    identity: A flame kept burning for others.
  prayShrineBoost: 0.25
  prayShrineLine: And you knelt at the old stone. The deep remembers its own - it
    is part of why you are here at all.
  emptyHandedLine: You came down empty-handed. That is its own kind of freedom -
    choose as you will.
  eggFossilLine: And something older stirs at the edge of you - bone that predates
    the parish. Not yet. Not tonight.
  eggMillLine: Somewhere above, a machine remembers your hands. Keep that. It will
    matter.
